    "causal_summary": "Phase 002 of the numbered-snippet-filename deprecation. Fix playbook-generator.cjs so it emits descriptive-slug scenario filenames (with an optional stage: frontmatter field) instead of AG-NNN.md, and re-verify that the sk-doc convention docs (create-feature-catalog, create-manual-testing-playbook), their templates, and the four /create:* generator YAMLs already forbid numbered per-feature filenames. Small foundation phase — no folders renamed, no existing files touched here.",
